OL,3,GNEWSAFormer BBC journalist swaps
OL,4,Anewsroom for train cab
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former journalist and radio presenter
OL,7,Fsaid she made a "brilliant" choice when
OL,8,Fshe chose to swap careers to become a
OL,9,Ftrain driver.
OL,11,FAlex Worsick decided to apply for the
OL,12,Frole with Northern in 2024, after
OL,13,Fworking at BBC Radio Lancashire for 22
OL,14,Fyears as a producer and news reader.
OL,16,FWhen she heard an interview with Lauren
OL,17,FPugh, who had been invited on to talk
OL,18,Fabout her experience of working as a
OL,19,Fdriver, it sounded like the perfect
OL,20,Ffit.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
