OL,3,GNEWSAFormer BBC journalist swaps
OL,4,Anewsroom for train cab
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought, 'I'm 47, I've got another
OL,7,F20 years to work, at least until I get
OL,8,Fa state pension, that's an entire new
OL,9,Fera to get a new career under your
OL,10,Fbelt'" she said.
